{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后李佳芯（Ali）近期挑戰第一次演舞台劇，與陳湛文、劉漪琳等人合演舞台劇《見面即地獄》。</p><p>Ali早前講過自己同一時間拍劇同排練舞台劇，自覺好似唔識做戲咁，陷入崩潰邊緣，點知女神似乎真係「理智斷線」，尋日（12日）晒出多張排練相，當中最令人注</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.768776+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:28:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_hash":"33f85a195d9374f40229ccdfa847bbd1c75024574f1b380604c3a233cd04552e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}